  "template": "<div lang=\"es\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/coleccion/polimero-mundial/oman-5-rials-2010/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Banco Central de Omán — 5 Rials (2010)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/coleccion/polimero-mundial/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Catálogo de Billetes de Polímero Mundial</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Billetes de Polímero Mundial &middot; Omán &middot; 40&ordm; Día Nacional</span>\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">Cinco Rials Conmemorativo</h1>\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Sustrato Híbrido &middot; Sultán Qaboos bin Said &middot; Nizwa</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button data-zoom-trigger=\"oman-5-rials-2010\" aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete\" style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\">\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/oman-cbo-5-rials-2010-hibrido.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img src=\"/uploads/oman-cbo-5-rials-2010-hibrido.jpg\" alt=\"Billete conmemorativo de 5 Rials del Banco Central de Omán, anverso arriba con retrato del Sultán Qaboos, reverso abajo con la ciudad fortificada de Nizwa\" width=\"564\" height=\"565\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\" />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Ampliar</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">País</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Omán</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Entidad Emisora</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">البنك المركزي العماني (Banco Central de Omán)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denominación</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Cinco Rials (خمسة ريالات)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Sustrato híbrido &mdash; núcleo de polímero laminado con capas externas de papel de seguridad texturizado<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Giesecke+Devrient (G+D), Leipzig, Alemania</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Serie / Fecha</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">40&ordm; Día Nacional, año 1431 H / 2010 G; circulación desde el 22 de noviembre de 2010</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Firmante</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Qaboos bin Said Al Said (سلطان عمان / Sultán de Omán)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensiones</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">153 &times; 76 mm</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia de Catálogo</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-44a (B233a en <em>The Banknote Book</em>)</span></div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Billete ampliado\" data-zoom-dialog=\"oman-5-rials-2010\" hidden class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button data-zoom-close aria-label=\"Cerrar\" style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\">&times;</button>\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out disabled=\"true\" aria-label=\"Alejar\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&minus;</button>\n                <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button disabled=\"false\" data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Acercar\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); touch-action:none;\">\n                <picture><source srcset=\"/uploads/oman-cbo-5-rials-2010-hibrido.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" /><img data-zoom-image src=\"/uploads/oman-cbo-5-rials-2010-hibrido.jpg\" alt=\"Billete de Omán, vista ampliada\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" /></picture>\n              </div>\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Arrastra para mover &middot; Rueda del ratón para ampliar</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Contexto Histórico</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Un homenaje al aniversario nacional:</strong> emitido para celebrar el 40&ordm; Día Nacional de Omán (1970&ndash;2010), este billete usa un sustrato híbrido de G+D que integra un núcleo de polímero laminado con capas externas de papel protector, combinando la resistencia del plástico con la fricción y el relieve táctil del papel tradicional &mdash;un enfoque distinto al polímero puro Guardian&reg; usado por otros bancos centrales.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> retrato del Sultán Qaboos bin Said con turbante tradicional; al centro, la Universidad Sultán Qaboos y su Torre del Reloj; el Escudo Nacional (puñal Khanjar sobre cimitarras cruzadas) en ambas esquinas superiores.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> la ciudad fortificada de Nizwa, con su torre defensiva y la cúpula de la Mezquita Al-Qala; el logotipo &ldquo;40th NATIONAL DAY&rdquo; en la zona superior.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Ventana Varifeye&reg;:</strong> apertura translúcida a la izquierda con el contorno calado del puñal Khanjar sobre película plástica ópticamente reactiva.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Dispositivo SPARK&reg;:</strong> el puñal Khanjar impreso con tinta magnética verde brillante genera un destello dinámico según el ángulo de inclinación.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Marca de agua:</strong> retrato tridimensional del Sultán Qaboos junto al numeral &ldquo;5&rdquo; en electrotipo, visible al trasluz.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colorido:</strong> rojo carmín, púrpura, ocre y verde multicolor.</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notas</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">1. Banknote World, &ldquo;Oman 5 Rials Banknote, 2010, P-44, UNC, Commemorative, 40th National Day&rdquo;, <em>banknoteworld.com</em>; Numista, &ldquo;5 Rials — Oman&rdquo;, nota #210076, <em>en.numista.com</em>: sustrato híbrido con núcleo de polímero, ventana Varifeye&reg; e impresión por Giesecke+Devrient.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
