      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/world-polymer/oman-5-rials-2010/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Central Bank of Oman — 5 Rials (2010)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/world-polymer/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; World polymer banknote catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">World Polymer Banknotes &middot; Oman &middot; 40&ordm; National Day</span>\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">Five Commemorative Rials</h1>\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Hybrid Substrate &middot; Sultan Qaboos bin Said &middot; Nizwa</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button data-zoom-trigger=\"oman-5-rials-2010\" aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote\" style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\">\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/oman-cbo-5-rials-2010-hibrido.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img src=\"/uploads/oman-cbo-5-rials-2010-hibrido.jpg\" alt=\"Banknote conmemorativo de 5 Rials del Banco Central de Omán, obverse arriba con portrait of Sultán Qaboos, reverse abajo con la ciudad fortificada de Nizwa\" width=\"564\" height=\"565\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\" />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Oman</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">البنك المركزي العماني (Central Bank of Oman)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Five Rials (خمسة ريالات)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Hybrid substrate &mdash; laminated polymer core with textured security-paper outer layers<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Printer</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Giesecke+Devrient (G+D), Leipzig, Germany</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Series / Date</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">40&ordm; National Day, year 1431 H / 2010 G; Circulation since November 22, 2010</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Signatory</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Qaboos bin Said Al Said (سلطان عمان / Sultan of Oman)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensions</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">153 &times; 76 mm</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-44a (B233a in<em>The Banknote Book</em>)</span></div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\" data-zoom-dialog=\"oman-5-rials-2010\" hidden class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button data-zoom-close aria-label=\"Close\" style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\">&times;</button>\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out disabled=\"true\" aria-label=\"Zoom out\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&minus;</button>\n                <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button disabled=\"false\" data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); touch-action:none;\">\n                <picture><source srcset=\"/uploads/oman-cbo-5-rials-2010-hibrido.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" /><img data-zoom-image src=\"/uploads/oman-cbo-5-rials-2010-hibrido.jpg\" alt=\"Banknote of Omán, enlarged view\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" /></picture>\n              </div>\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">A tribute to the national anniversary:</strong>Issued to celebrate Oman's 40&ordm; National Day (1970&ndash;2010), this banknote uses a G+D hybrid substrate that integrates a polymer core laminated with outer layers of protective paper, combining the strength of plastic with the friction and tactile relief of traditional paper &mdash;a different approach to the pure Guardian&reg; polymer used by other central banks.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key details</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Obverse:</strong>portrait of Sultan Qaboos bin Said wearing a traditional turban; at center, Sultan Qaboos University and its Clock Tower; the National Emblem (a khanjar dagger over crossed swords) in both upper corners.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>the fortified city of Nizwa, with its defensive tower and the dome of the Al-Qala Mosque; the &ldquo;40th NATIONAL DAY&rdquo; logo in the upper area.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Varifeye&reg; window:</strong>translucent opening on the left with the openwork outline of the Khanjar dagger on optically reactive plastic film.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">SPARK&reg; Device:</strong>The Khanjar dagger printed with bright green magnetic ink generates a dynamic flash depending on the angle of inclination.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Watermark:</strong>three-dimensional portrait of Sultan Qaboos alongside the electrotype numeral &ldquo;5&rdquo;, visible when held to the light.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Color:</strong>carmine red, purple, ocher, and multicolored green.</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notes</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">1. Banknote World, &ldquo;Oman 5 Rials Banknote, 2010, P-44, UNC, Commemorative, 40th National Day&rdquo;,<em>banknoteworld.com</em>; Numista, &ldquo;5 Rials — Oman&rdquo;, note #210076,<em>en.numista.com</em>: hybrid substrate with polymer core, Varifeye&reg; window and printing by Giesecke+Devrient.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "Five Commemorative Rials",
      "eyebrow": "World Polymer Banknotes · Omán · 40&ordm; Día Nacional"
    }
